# Faiths and Philosophies

Of course, faith can express itself in more ways than venerating a single deity—or a deity at all. A few examples of non-deific religions and philosophies are presented below.

## Atheism

While most concede that the gods exist, some do not view them as worthy of worship, and a few even deny their presence altogether.

### Edicts

Pursue your own agenda with faith in your ability to excel.

#### Anathema

Offer prayers to a deity.
